<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to Nest Hive</title>

    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 40px 16px;
        background-color: #f4f7fb;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        color: #1f2937;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
      }

      .header {
        background-color: #111827;
        padding: 25px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .logo {
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 26px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .logo span {
        color: #6366f1;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 40px 32px;
      }

      .title {
        font-size: 24px;
        color: #111827;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .message {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #6b7280;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .greeting {
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #374151;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }

      .next-step {
        background-color: #eef2ff;
        border-left: 4px solid #6366f1;
        padding: 16px 18px;
        margin: 25px 0;
        border-radius: 6px;
      }

      .next-step-title {
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #111827;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .next-step-text {
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #6b7280;
      }

      .footer {
        border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        background-color: #fafafa;
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .footer p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #9ca3af;
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 480px) {
        body {
          padding: 20px 10px;
        }

        .content {
          padding: 30px 20px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="logo">Nest<span>Hive</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p class="greeting">Hi <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>

        <h1 class="title">Welcome to Nest Hive! 🎉</h1>

        <p class="message">
          Your email address has been successfully verified, and your owner
          account is now ready to use.
        </p>

        <p class="message">
          You can now log in to your Nest Hive account. To continue with the
          owner onboarding process and access the full dashboard features, you
          need to submit your KYC details for verification.
        </p>

        <div class="next-step">
          <div class="next-step-title">What's next?</div>

          <div class="next-step-text">
            Log in to your account and submit the required KYC information. Once
            your KYC is reviewed and approved, you will be able to access the
            owner dashboard features and continue with your activities on Nest
            Hive.
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="message">
          Thank you for choosing Nest Hive. We look forward to having you as
          part of our owner community.
        </p>

        <p class="message">Welcome aboard!</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Nest Hive. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
